{
  "facts": [
    {
      "topic": "scope",
      "statement": "The entry selects compression parameters, calls ZSTD_compressStream2 with continue, flush, and end directives, then decompresses the result.",
      "evidence": [
        {"unit_id":"u-9dc9e88ae722c8cbe085","start_line":59,"end_line":65,"role":"primary","dependency_reason":""},
        {"unit_id":"u-9dc9e88ae722c8cbe085","start_line":69,"end_line":135,"role":"dependency","dependency_reason":"Shows the streaming calls and directives."},
        {"unit_id":"u-9dc9e88ae722c8cbe085","start_line":185,"end_line":187,"role":"dependency","dependency_reason":"Shows the decompression call after compression."}
      ],
      "absence_claim": false,
      "audited_unit_ids": []
    },
    {
      "topic": "trigger",
      "statement": "FUZZ_randomCParams selects a strategy from ZSTD_STRATEGY_MIN through ZSTD_STRATEGY_MAX using producer bytes, adjusts the parameters, and FUZZ_setRandomParameters applies the resulting strategy to the compression context.",
      "evidence": [
        {"unit_id":"u-194debf8ea4cd55b47ba","start_line":44,"end_line":56,"role":"primary","dependency_reason":""},
        {"unit_id":"u-194debf8ea4cd55b47ba","start_line":101,"end_line":110,"role":"dependency","dependency_reason":"Applies the selected strategy."},
        {"unit_id":"u-7eca6778229ce19a7b95","start_line":29,"end_line":49,"role":"dependency","dependency_reason":"Shows how producer bytes select a value in the requested range."}
      ],
      "absence_claim": false,
      "audited_unit_ids": []
    },
    {
      "topic": "contract",
      "statement": "After the change, ZSTD_adjustCParams_internal conditionally cascades an excluded selected strategy toward an included lower strategy, eventually reaching ZSTD_fast when the double-fast compressor is excluded.",
      "evidence": [
        {"unit_id":"u-31b9fce4fcddd0beca8e","start_line":1470,"end_line":1510,"role":"primary","dependency_reason":""}
      ],
      "absence_claim": false,
      "audited_unit_ids": []
    },
    {
      "topic": "contract",
      "statement": "After the change, block-compressor dispatch uses ZSTD_COMPRESSBLOCK_* entries for strategies and dictionary modes, selects a row-based table when enabled, and asserts that the selected compressor is nonnull.",
      "evidence": [
        {"unit_id":"u-0adc4df26dbe6bc8986a","start_line":3032,"end_line":3114,"role":"primary","dependency_reason":""}
      ],
      "absence_claim": false,
      "audited_unit_ids": []
    },
    {
      "topic": "counterevidence",
      "statement": "Before the change, the selector directly listed compressor functions for the strategies and asserted a nonnull selection; the before-version parameter adjustment had no exclusion cascade in its complete function.",
      "evidence": [
        {"unit_id":"u-e537147eba1ba4b356a4","start_line":2990,"end_line":3061,"role":"primary","dependency_reason":""},
        {"unit_id":"u-facf31de921eddbcf157","start_line":1459,"end_line":1554,"role":"dependency","dependency_reason":"Complete before-version parameter-adjustment function."}
      ],
      "absence_claim": true,
      "audited_unit_ids": ["u-facf31de921eddbcf157"]
    },
    {
      "topic": "configuration",
      "statement": "In the after-version libzstd.mk, both compressor-exclusion variables default to zero. Nonzero values add exclusion defines to CFLAGS; the supplied build script delegates compilation to fuzz.py, so these lines alone do not establish the target's effective exclusion flags.",
      "evidence": [
        {"unit_id":"u-3bbc39a69a0b005f3b1d","start_line":50,"end_line":51,"role":"primary","dependency_reason":""},
        {"unit_id":"u-3bbc39a69a0b005f3b1d","start_line":184,"end_line":190,"role":"dependency","dependency_reason":"Shows the conditional defines for nonzero exclusion variables."},
        {"unit_id":"u-043cf5aa9ced10a35cb6","start_line":19,"end_line":24,"role":"dependency","dependency_reason":"Shows the build delegation whose effective flags remain to be established."}
      ],
      "absence_claim": false,
      "audited_unit_ids": []
    },
    {
      "topic": "target_route",
      "statement": "ZSTD_compressStream2 initializes the context when needed and delegates single-worker compression to ZSTD_compressStream_generic. In the after-version sequence-store builder, the ordinary parser and external-producer fallback select a block compressor using applied strategy, row-match-finder setting, and dictionary mode.",
      "evidence": [
        {"unit_id":"u-8701eeeda36b1074f936","start_line":6285,"end_line":6311,"role":"primary","dependency_reason":""},
        {"unit_id":"u-8701eeeda36b1074f936","start_line":6365,"end_line":6369,"role":"primary","dependency_reason":""},
        {"unit_id":"u-e47bbab13fc8d06f6025","start_line":3330,"end_line":3355,"role":"dependency","dependency_reason":"Shows the later sequence-store dispatch routes."}
      ],
      "absence_claim": false,
      "audited_unit_ids": []
    },
    {
      "topic": "alternative",
      "statement": "The after-version sequence-store builder has distinct routes: short blocks skip compression, a successful external sequence producer returns without block-compressor selection, and LDM routes through ZSTD_ldm_blockCompress, which itself selects a block compressor.",
      "evidence": [
        {"unit_id":"u-e47bbab13fc8d06f6025","start_line":3206,"end_line":3215,"role":"primary","dependency_reason":""},
        {"unit_id":"u-e47bbab13fc8d06f6025","start_line":3242,"end_line":3285,"role":"primary","dependency_reason":""},
        {"unit_id":"u-e47bbab13fc8d06f6025","start_line":3286,"end_line":3327,"role":"primary","dependency_reason":""},
        {"unit_id":"u-13f003d0cb9218072e68","start_line":664,"end_line":684,"role":"dependency","dependency_reason":"Shows LDM's own block-compressor selection and call."}
      ],
      "absence_claim": false,
      "audited_unit_ids": []
    },
    {
      "topic": "consequence",
      "statement": "Existing harness checks reject compression or decompression errors, require stream decompression to finish, and require both ordinary and in-place decompression to reproduce the input size and bytes.",
      "evidence": [
        {"unit_id":"u-9dc9e88ae722c8cbe085","start_line":81,"end_line":91,"role":"primary","dependency_reason":""},
        {"unit_id":"u-9dc9e88ae722c8cbe085","start_line":124,"end_line":151,"role":"primary","dependency_reason":""},
        {"unit_id":"u-9dc9e88ae722c8cbe085","start_line":185,"end_line":205,"role":"primary","dependency_reason":""},
        {"unit_id":"u-a7cd9e43defd8d40468a","start_line":40,"end_line":47,"role":"dependency","dependency_reason":"Defines the assertions and error check used by the entry."}
      ],
      "absence_claim": false,
      "audited_unit_ids": []
    },
    {
      "topic": "counterevidence",
      "statement": "The entry resets only the compression session before parameter selection and on completed frames; it also permits parameter reselection after a completed frame. These are existing state and call-sequence routes relevant to strategy selection.",
      "evidence": [
        {"unit_id":"u-9dc9e88ae722c8cbe085","start_line":63,"end_line":67,"role":"primary","dependency_reason":""},
        {"unit_id":"u-9dc9e88ae722c8cbe085","start_line":88,"end_line":102,"role":"primary","dependency_reason":""},
        {"unit_id":"u-298245ec31957998eed7","start_line":1354,"end_line":1369,"role":"dependency","dependency_reason":"Defines what session-only reset changes."}
      ],
      "absence_claim": false,
      "audited_unit_ids": []
    }
  ],
  "missing_information": [
    "The effective stream_round_trip compilation path and flags through tests/fuzz/fuzz.py and tests/fuzz/Makefile, specifically whether either compressor-exclusion variable is enabled.",
    "The definitions of ZSTD_STRATEGY_MIN, ZSTD_STRATEGY_MAX, and the ZSTD_COMPRESSBLOCK_* macros used by dispatch.",
    "The calls connecting ZSTD_compressStream_generic and context initialization to ZSTD_adjustCParams_internal and ZSTD_buildSeqStore."
  ],
  "requested_symbols": [
    "ZSTD_STRATEGY_MIN",
    "ZSTD_STRATEGY_MAX",
    "ZSTD_COMPRESSBLOCK_*",
    "ZSTD_compressStream_generic",
    "ZSTD_CCtx_init_compressStream2"
  ],
  "requested_paths": [
    "tests/fuzz/fuzz.py",
    "tests/fuzz/Makefile",
    "lib/compress/zstd_lazy.h",
    "lib/compress/zstd_opt.h",
    "lib/compress/zstd_double_fast.h"
  ]
}
